<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel banks for standstill extension.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel banks for standstill extension.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel said in a statement on Monday that representatives of creditor banks had recommended the extension of a debt standstill agreement until December.</p>
<p>&quot;Representatives of the banking syndicate have decided to recommend to the syndicate an extension of the standstill to December,&quot; said a statement issued by the Anglo-French Channel Tunnel operator in Paris and London.</p>
<p>The debt standstill went into effect in September 1995 and was due to run for 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
